#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]single and Task Link schedule/priority, and link-roll paths with tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]block-id-prompt deletes emptied entries on unlink and Task [/bold #D7AFFF]   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]Link removal[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]bip[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bip: add an emptied-entry pass to the block-id-prompt cleanup planner [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the Ctrl+Shift+Enter selected-link deletion, judged over all of a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note's edits, and align the dedicated-bullet check.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]task-status-cycler take-back and deferred-only close[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cycler[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycler: delete every entry the same-day successor take-back empties, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](per closed_entries) the closed entry a deferred-only Pomodoro close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]empties.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli docs, optional decision record, and full deploy[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after nav, bip, cycler[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: document the plugin-side emptied-entry rule in bob-cli docs, write[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the decision record if accepted, then run the full plugin suite and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deploy all plugins.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-88","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-88.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-6fd540c90472117a547f389889ede41a","started_at":"2026-10-16T11:31:36.056950+00:00","state":"a